<section id="faq" class="section paper"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><h2>Questions, answered plainly.</h2></div><div class="faq"><details><summary>What is Cognition?</summary><p>Cognition is Reserve Nutrition's first release: a caffeine-free daily gummy for adults who want a more considered ritual, with every active named and dosed.</p></details><details><summary>How many gummies are in a jar?</summary><p>Each jar holds 30 softened-cube gummies, ten of each of the three flavors. The exact serving size is being finalized with our formulator.</p></details><details><summary>Why more than one gummy per serving?</summary><p>Full doses need real mass. 2 g of Magtein® alone is more than one gummy can carry, so each serving is spread across several small cubes that stay an enjoyable confection rather than a compromise.</p></details><details><summary>When will it be available?</summary><p>Join the first-release list and we will share timing once the final formula, manufacturing, and stability work are complete.</p></details></div></div></section>
